  "notes": "VERB TYPE:\n{他動詞|たどうし} (transitive verb)\n\nGodan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}) ending in す\n- {醸|かも}さない (negative)\n- {醸|かも}して (te-form)\n- {醸|かも}した (past)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {酒|さけ}を{醸|かも}す - to brew sake\n- {物議|ぶつぎ}を{醸|かも}す - to create controversy\n- {雰囲気|ふんいき}を{醸|かも}し{出|だ}す - to create an atmosphere\n- {波紋|はもん}を{醸|かも}す - to cause ripples (figuratively)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {醸造|じょうぞう} - brewing, fermentation\n- {発酵|はっこう} - fermentation\n- {味噌|みそ}を{醸|かも}す - to brew miso\n\nUSAGE:\nThe compound {醸|かも}し{出|だ}す is commonly used for sense 2, meaning to create or evoke an atmosphere or feeling.",
